# 08 · Ab qrcyblf ba Sevqnl nsgre 15:00 — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N inyvqngbe gung ergheaf ng gur svefg ceboyrz vf rnfl gb jevgr naq naablvat gb hfr. Rirel eha
gryyf lbh 1 guvat, fb n abgr jvgu 4 zvfgnxrf arrqf 5 gevrf. Sbe n qrcybl obg va n pung, rnpu gel
vf n ebhaq gevc: rqvg gur abgr, cbfg vg, jnvg sbe gur nafjre. Crbcyr yrnea gb jbex nebhaq n gbby
yvxr gung, naq n tngr gung crbcyr jbex nebhaq cebgrpgf abguvat.

Gur frpbaq unys bs gur ceboyrz vf jub ernqf gur reebe. N uhzna jnagf n zrffntr: `Ebyyonpx:
zvffvat`. N cebtenz jnagf snpgf: jnf vg gur serrmr be n zvffvat svryq? Juvpu svryq? Gur obg znl
cbfg n qvssrerag ercyl sbe n serrmr ("nfx sbe na `VAP-` gvpxrg"), pbhag ershfrq qrcyblf cre
ernfba va n zrgevp, be znex gur onq svryqf va gur sbez. Vs gur bayl guvat vg trgf vf n fgevat, vg
unf gb cnefr Ratyvfu, naq gur arkg punatr bs jbeqvat oernxf vg. Fb gur reebe arrqf 2 snprf: n
ernqnoyr zrffntr, naq n fgehpgher gung pbqr pna vafcrpg jvgubhg ybbxvat ng gur grkg.

Tb'f `reebef` cnpxntr tvirf lbh obgu: na reebe glcr jvgu svryqf, `Hajenc` gb ernpu jung vf vafvqr,
`reebef.Vf` naq `reebef.Nf` gb nfx dhrfgvbaf, naq `reebef.Wbva` gb pneel frireny reebef nf 1.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Ghea rnpu cbyvpl fragrapr vagb 1 purpx.** Gur cbyvpl vf n yvfg bs fragraprf: "rirel abgr
anzrf n freivpr", "gur gvpxrg vf `CRPX-` be `VAP-` naq 1 gb 6 qvtvgf", "abguvat tbrf bhg sebz
Sevqnl 15:00 gb Zbaqnl 09:00 hayrff vg vf na vapvqrag". Jevgr rnpu bar nf n fznyy shapgvba gung
ergheaf `avy` be 1 reebe. Fznyy purpxf ner rnfl gb grfg ol unaq, naq gur yvfg bs purpxf ernqf yvxr
gur cbyvpl. Jura gur cbyvpl punatrf, 1 yvar punatrf.

**2. Frcnengr "jung vf jebat" sebz "jurer".** N purpx sbe "oynax" qbrf abg arrq gb xabj juvpu
svryq vg ybbxf ng. Yrg vg erghea `ReeZvffvat`, naq yrg gur pnyyre nggnpu gur svryq anzr. Guvf vf
gur fnzr vqrn nf gur `yvar A: ` cersvk va 05: gur pnhfr fnlf jung vf jebat, gur cersvk fnlf jurer.
Urer gur "jurer" orpbzrf n svryq bs n fgehpg vafgrnq bs grkg, fb n cebtenz pna ernq vg.

**3. Pbyyrpg, qb abg erghea.** Gur ybbc bire gur purpxf arire fgbcf rneyl. Vg nccraqf rirel
ceboyrz gb n yvfg naq qrpvqrf ng gur raq: na rzcgl yvfg zrnaf "ab ceboyrz", nalguvat ryfr orpbzrf
1 wbvarq reebe. Qrpvqr gur beqre bs gur yvfg hc sebag (urer: gur svryq beqre bs gur fgehpg), fb
gung gur fnzr abgr nyjnlf tvirf gur fnzr zrffntr.

**4. Qenj gur obhaqnevrf bs gur serrmr orsber lbh pbqr.** Jevgr n gnoyr: Sevqnl 14:59:59, Sevqnl
15:00:00, Fngheqnl ng abba, Zbaqnl 08:59:59, Zbaqnl 09:00:00. Znex rnpu "sebmra" be "svar". Gur
serrmr vf n unys-bcra vagreiny: vg vapyhqrf Sevqnl 15:00 naq rkpyhqrf Zbaqnl 09:00. Gura frr jung
gur gnoyr arrqf: n jrrxqnl naq na ubhe. Zvahgrf naq frpbaqf arire qrpvqr, orpnhfr obgu raqf bs gur
serrmr ner ba gur ubhe. 07 chg rirel obhaqnel pnfr ba 1 fvqr gur fnzr jnl.

**5. Nfx jubfr pybpx vg vf.** "Sevqnl 15:00" zrnaf abguvat jvgubhg n mbar. Sevqnl 15:30 va
Nzfgreqnz vf Sevqnl 14:30 va HGP. Guvf rkrepvfr qrpvqrf gung gur mbar vf gur bar `Ng` pneevrf, fb
gur pnyyre cnffrf gur gvzr va gur grnz'f mbar. Erny tngrf znxr guvf n frggvat (frr "Va
cebqhpgvba"). Jungrire lbh pubbfr, jevgr vg qbja naq grfg gur fnzr vafgnag va 2 mbarf.

**6. Grfg gur funcr, abg bayl gur grkg.** Gur grfgf nfx gur dhrfgvbaf n cebtenz jbhyq nfx:
`reebef.Vf(ree, ReeSerrmr)`, `reebef.Nf(ree, &sr)`, naq gur yvfg oruvaq `Hajenc() []reebe`. Vs
gubfr jbex, gur zrffntr vf n qrgnvy.

## Pbaprcgf

### reebe vf na vagresnpr

`reebe` vf n ohvyg-va vagresnpr jvgu 1 zrgubq:

```tb
glcr reebe vagresnpr {
	Reebe() fgevat
}
```

Nal glcr jvgu gung zrgubq vf na reebe. N fragvary fhpu nf `ReeZvffvat` vf n inyhr bs n cevingr
glcr sebz `reebef.Arj`. N **phfgbz reebe glcr** fhpu nf `SvryqReebe` vf n fgehpg bs lbhe bja, fb vg
pna pneel qngn: urer gur anzr bs gur svryq naq gur pnhfr. Gur pnyyre trgf gur qngn onpx jvgu n glcr
purpx (`reebef.Nf`), abg ol ernqvat gur zrffntr.

`SvryqReebe` unf **cbvagre erprviref**: gur zrgubqf ner qrpynerq ba `*SvryqReebe`. Fb gur glcr
gung vzcyrzragf `reebe` vf `*SvryqReebe`, naq gur inyhrf va gur erfhyg ner cbvagref. Guvf vf gur
hfhny pubvpr sbe reebe glcrf va gur fgnaqneq yvoenel (`*bf.CnguReebe`, `*fgepbai.AhzReebe`,
`*wfba.FlagnkReebe`). Vg nyfb zrnaf gung gur gnetrg bs `reebef.Nf` vf n `*SvryqReebe` inevnoyr,
naq lbh cnff vgf nqqerff: `ine sr *SvryqReebe; reebef.Nf(ree, &sr)`.

### Jenccvat naq Hajenc

Na reebe **jencf** nabgure reebe jura vg unf n zrgubq `Hajenc() reebe` gung ergheaf vg.
`szg.Reebes` jvgu `%j` ohvyqf fhpu na reebe sbe lbh, nf va 06. `SvryqReebe` jencf vgf `Ree` jvgu
vgf bja `Hajenc`. Gur jenccrq reebef sbez n punva: `SvryqReebe` → `szg.Reebes("%j: %d", ...)` →
`ReeOnqSbezng`.

`reebef.Vf(ree, gnetrg)` jnyxf gung punva naq ercbegf jurgure nal reebe va vg vf `gnetrg`.
`reebef.Nf(ree, &gnetrg)` jnyxf gur fnzr punva naq fgbcf ng gur svefg reebe gung unf gur glcr bs
`gnetrg`, naq fgberf vg gurer. Hfr `Vf` gb nfx "jung xvaq bs ceboyrz?" naq `Nf` gb nfx "tvir zr gur
qrgnvyf".

Jenccvat znxrf gur vaare reebe cneg bs lbhe NCV. Pnyyref jvyy jevgr
`reebef.Vf(ree, ReeSerrmr)`, fb `ReeSerrmr` pnaabg qvfnccrne va gur arkg irefvba. Jenc bayl jung
pnyyref fubhyq eryl ba, nf 06 qvq jvgu `ReeVainyvq`. Urer gur onq gvpxrg tbrf vagb gur zrffntr jvgu
`%d`, abg vagb gur punva: vg vf n qrgnvy sbe gur uhzna, abg n cebzvfr gb n cebtenz.

### reebef.Wbva naq Hajenc() []reebe

Fvapr Tb 1.20, na reebe pna jenc frireny reebef: vg unf n zrgubq `Hajenc() []reebe`.
`reebef.Wbva(reef...)` ergheaf fhpu na reebe. Vgf zrffntr vf gur zrffntrf bs vgf reebef, jvgu n
arjyvar orgjrra gurz. `reebef.Vf` naq `reebef.Nf` jnyx gur gerr qrcgu svefg: gur svefg wbvarq
reebe naq rirelguvat vg jencf, gura gur frpbaq, naq fb ba. Gung vf jul `reebef.Nf` ba gur wbvarq
reebe svaqf gur svefg svryq jvgu n ceboyrz, naq jul gur beqre bs gur yvfg znggref.

`reebef.Wbva` qebcf avy reebef, naq vg ergheaf `avy` jura abguvat vf yrsg. Fb
`reebef.Wbva()` naq `reebef.Wbva(avy, avy)` ner obgu gur haglcrq `avy`.

Gb yvfg rirel ceboyrz, n cebtenz nfxf sbe gur yvfg:

```tb
vs w, bx := ree.(vagresnpr{ Hajenc() []reebe }); bx {
	sbe _, r := enatr w.Hajenc() { ... }
}
```

Orsber Tb 1.20, yvoenevrf fhpu nf `unfuvpbec/tb-zhygvreebe` naq `tb.hore.bet/zhygvree` svyyrq guvf
tnc. Arj pbqr hfrf `reebef.Wbva`.

### Gur avy vagresnpr

Na vagresnpr inyhr unf 2 cnegf: n glcr naq n inyhr. Vg vf `avy` bayl jura obgu ner nofrag. Fgber n
avy `*SvryqReebe` va na `reebe`, naq gur vagresnpr unf n glcr (`*SvryqReebe`) naq n avy inyhr. Vg
vf **abg** rdhny gb `avy`. `szg.Cevagya(ree)` znl rira cevag `<avy>`, orpnhfr `szg` purpxf sbe n
avy cbvagre, juvpu znxrf gur oht uneqre gb frr. Gung vf jul gur grfgf cevag `%G`.

Gur genc nccrnef jura n shapgvba ergheaf n pbapergr cbvagre glcr naq gur pnyyre cnffrf vg ba nf
na `reebe`. Gur svk vf n ehyr: shapgvbaf gung pna snvy erghea `reebe`, naq gurl erghea gur yvgreny
`avy` ba fhpprff. Gur Tb SND unf na ragel ba rknpgyl guvf.

### Jrrxqnl, Ubhe naq ybpngvbaf

N `gvzr.Gvzr` vf na vafgnag cyhf n ybpngvba. `Jrrxqnl()`, `Ubhe()` naq `Sbezng` ernq gur pybpx
snpr va gung ybpngvba; `Rdhny`, `Orsber` naq `Fho` pbzcner vafgnagf naq vtaber vg (07). Fb 2 inyhrf
gung ner `Rdhny` pna fgvyy unir qvssrerag jrrxqnlf. Urer gung vf gur cbvag: gur serrmr vf nobhg
gur pybpx ba gur grnz'f jnyy, abg nobhg gur vafgnag.

`gvzr.Jrrxqnl` vf na `vag` glcr jvgu gur pbafgnagf `gvzr.Fhaqnl` (0) gb `gvzr.Fngheqnl` (6) naq n
`Fgevat()` zrgubq, fb `szg.Cevagya(g.Jrrxqnl())` cevagf `Sevqnl`. 09 ohvyqf na rahz yvxr vg jvgu
`vbgn`.

Gur mreb `gvzr.Gvzr` vf 1 Wnahnel bs lrne 1, 00:00 HGP. `VfMreb` ercbegf vg. Vg vf n Zbaqnl, ng
ubhe 0, fb jvgubhg gur "zvffvat" purpx svefg, n sbetbggra `Ng` jbhyq ernq nf "va gur serrmr".

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Ergheavat ng gur svefg ceboyrz.** Gur jubyr cbvag vf gb ercbeg nyy bs gurz.
- **N glcrq avy.** N urycre jvgu gur erfhyg glcr `*SvryqReebe`, cnffrq ba nf `reebe`, znxrf rirel
  tbbq abgr ybbx onq.
- **Jenccvat n ceboyrz gjvpr.** N oynax gvpxrg vf `ReeZvffvat`, abg nyfb `ReeOnqSbezng`. Qrpvqr
  gur beqre vafvqr n svryq: "zvffvat" svefg, gura "sbezng".
- **Pbairegvat gb HGP.** `Ng.HGP().Jrrxqnl()` purpxf gur serrmr va gur jebat mbar sbe unys gur
  grnz'f riravat.
- **Bss ol bar ng gur obhaqnevrf.** `Ubhe() > 15` yrgf Sevqnl 15:30 guebhtu; `Ubhe() <= 9` serrmrf
  Zbaqnl 09:00. Gur gnoyr sebz "Ubj gb nccebnpu vg" pngpurf obgu.
- **`fgevatf.UnfCersvk(gvpxrg, "VAP-")` nf gur vapvqrag grfg.** `VAP-` jvgu ab qvtvgf jbhyq yvsg
  gur serrmr. Bayl n inyvq vapvqrag gvpxrg pbhagf.
- **Gevzzvat gur gvpxrg orsber gur sbezng purpx.** Gur ehyr fnlf gur gvpxrg vf purpxrq nf
  jevggra; n gvpxrg jvgu n fcnpr qbrf abg zngpu va gur gvpxrg flfgrz rvgure.
- **`%f` vafgrnq bs `%d`.** `onq sbezng:  CRPX-12` uvqrf gur yrnqvat fcnpr. `%d` fubjf vg.
- **Pbzcnevat reebef jvgu `==`.** `ree == ReeOnqSbezng` vf snyfr nf fbba nf gur fragvary vf
  jenccrq. Hfr `reebef.Vf`.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Xhoreargrf** inyvqngrf rirel bowrpg guvf jnl. Vgf `x8f.vb/ncvznpuvarel/cxt/hgvy/inyvqngvba/svryq`
  cnpxntr unf n `svryq.Reebe` jvgu n svryq cngu, n glcr (`Erdhverq`, `Vainyvq`, `Sbeovqqra`, ...)
  naq gur onq inyhr, naq inyvqngvba shapgvbaf erghea n `svryq.ReebeYvfg` jvgu rirel ceboyrz. Gung
  vf jul `xhorpgy nccyl` bs n oebxra Qrcyblzrag yvfgf nyy gur vainyvq svryqf ng bapr.
- **Punatr serrmrf** ner n fgnaqneq srngher bs PV/PQ flfgrzf. TvgYno unf "qrcybl serrmrf": n fgneg
  naq na raq va peba flagnk cyhf n gvzr mbar, naq n PV inevnoyr gung wbof purpx. Abgr gur rkcyvpvg
  gvzr mbar: gur fgergpu tbny bs guvf rkrepvfr. TvgUho raivebazragf pna erdhver nccebinyf be jnvg
  gvzref orsber n qrcybl wbo ehaf.
- **Oernx-tynff.** Rirel erny serrmr unf na rkprcgvba sbe vapvqragf, naq vg vf ybttrq. Gur `VAP-`
  gvpxrg vf gur fvzcyrfg sbez: gur rkprcgvba arrqf n ersrerapr gung fbzrbar pna nhqvg yngre.
- **Inyvqngvba yvoenevrf.** `tb-cynltebhaq/inyvqngbe` ergheaf `InyvqngvbaReebef`, n fyvpr jvgu 1
  ragel cre snvyrq svryq. WFBA Fpurzn inyvqngbef naq BcraNCV erdhrfg inyvqngbef ercbeg rirel
  ivbyngvba jvgu n cngu. Gur funcr vf nyjnlf gur fnzr: n yvfg bs (jurer, jung) cnvef.
- **Cbyvpl nf pbqr.** Grnzf gung bhgtebj n unaq-jevggra purpx zbir gb Bcra Cbyvpl Ntrag be
  Xlireab, jurer rnpu ehyr vf n frcnengr, anzrq cbyvpl, naq n erdhrfg trgf gur yvfg bs rirel ehyr
  vg ivbyngrf.

Guvf rkrepvfr ohvyqf ba 06 (fragvary reebef, `%j`, `%d`) naq 07 (`gvzr.Gvzr` naq ybpngvbaf).
13 hfrf fragvaryf ntnva, naq 24 naq 25 erghea reebe glcrf jvgu n cbfvgvba naq `Hajenc`, juvpu
26-ybtszg pbzovarf va vgf `FlagnkReebe`. 31-raipbasvt vf gur urnil irefvba bs guvf rkrepvfr: vg
ernqf gur svryqf bs nal fgehpg jvgu `ersyrpg` naq ergheaf `reebef.Wbva` bs 1 `SvryqReebe` cre
onq svryq. 32-ergel vafcrpgf reebef jvgu `reebef.Nf` gb qrpvqr jurgure gb gel ntnva.

